00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:49.310
It reads, Dated August twenty seventh.

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:56.080
Dear governors, the U.S. Department of Health
and Human Services and CDC are rapidly making

00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:02.860
preparations to implement large scale distribution
of Cauvin 19 vaccines in the fall of 2020.

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:07.350
This vaccine distribution program is expected
to be a public health effort of significant

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:12.340
scale, potentially involving hundreds of millions
of vaccine doses to be distributed across

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:18.280
the U.S.. CDC has contracted with McKesson
to distribute these vaccines to state and

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:24.010
