00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:32.490
McKesson must quickly open new distribution
centers and obtain new permits and licenses.

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:37.150
These applications may be submitted in McKesson's
name or in the name of one of its subsidiaries.

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:43.730
Going on to say, In the near future, the appropriate
state licensing agency will receive permit

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:51.730
applications for the new distribution facilities
going on to say that states should consider

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:57.710
