distributed.

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:16.770
Your assistance in helping expedite the issuance
of licenses and permits required for this

00:03:16.770 --> 00:03:22.830
will be critical to the success of this public
health effort to mitigate the threat presented

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:25.849
by Kofod 19.

