00:04:45.379 --> 00:04:47.419
use authorization.

00:04:47.419 --> 00:04:52.240
First of all, it's never been done before
with a vaccine or at least a major vaccine

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:55.380
that presumably billions of people are going
to want.

00:04:55.380 --> 00:05:00.469
We've done emergency use authorizations on
technicalities and we've done emergency use

00:05:00.469 --> 00:05:06.069
authorizations on things like hydroxy chloroquine
room desk, severe convalescent plasma.

00:05:06.069 --> 00:05:11.539
Now, how well did the hydroxy chloroquine
